{"2312600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Watch Yo Plane", "steam_appid": 2312600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As flight rookies you take it upon yourselves to become certified pilots by all means. This is a 2 player co-op adventure! Work together to pilot the plane and survive brutal obstacles and challenges ahead without crashing too much...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-Piloting The Plane</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player control <strong>pitch</strong> (up &amp; down), the other player controls <strong>roll</strong> (left &amp; right).<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312600/extras/833cffc6adbea9628f3f17d0eb45bbd4.poster.avif?t=1784654104\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312600/extras/833cffc6adbea9628f3f17d0eb45bbd4.webm?t=1784654104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312600/extras/833cffc6adbea9628f3f17d0eb45bbd4.mp4?t=1784654104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's a plane! It's a car! Its a Barrel?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to <strong>navigate</strong> through a range of <strong>obstacles</strong> and <strong>minigames</strong> that will test your friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312600/extras/17de896f545893976b8bf4268a356f92.poster.avif?t=1784654104\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312600/extras/17de896f545893976b8bf4268a356f92.webm?t=1784654104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312600/extras/17de896f545893976b8bf4268a356f92.mp4?t=1784654104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You will crash... A LOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From walls to moving spikes, spinning fans and swinging balls. <strong>It only get's harder</strong> the further you get...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312600/extras/abb68e8ccc0c8bcf06cd34954c4ad474.poster.avif?t=1784654104\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312600/extras/abb68e8ccc0c8bcf06cd34954c4ad474.webm?t=1784654104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312600/extras/abb68e8ccc0c8bcf06cd34954c4ad474.mp4?t=1784654104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Outfits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your game face on before setting off for your journey, looking like a <strong>true</strong> <strong>professional</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312600/extras/1a6630b8a6cd3fb1916ebd2d3ecb4755.poster.avif?t=1784654104\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312600/extras/1a6630b8a6cd3fb1916ebd2d3ecb4755.webm?t=1784654104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312600/extras/1a6630b8a6cd3fb1916ebd2d3ecb4755.mp4?t=1784654104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Solo &amp; 2 Player Co-Op Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌎 3 different zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 A bunch of minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 Death counter to remind you how many mistakes you made</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Checkpoints to save progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⌛ Leader board to compete with others</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're coordinating perfectly or arguing over whose fault the crash was, every win is shared. Can you and your co-pilot make it through the chaos and reach the finish line?..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game offers average of 1-2h of playtime</strong><br></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As flight rookies you take it upon yourselves to become certified pilots by all means. This is a 2 player co-op adventure! Work together to pilot the plane and survive brutal obstacles and challenges ahead without crashing too much...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-Piloting The Plane</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player control <strong>pitch</strong> (up &amp; down), the other player controls <strong>roll</strong> (left &amp; right).<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312600/extras/833cffc6adbea9628f3f17d0eb45bbd4.poster.avif?t=1784654104\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312600/extras/833cffc6adbea9628f3f17d0eb45bbd4.webm?t=1784654104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2312600/extras/833cffc6adbea9628f3f17d0eb45bbd4.mp4?t=1784654104\" type=\"video/mp4\"